Cell["\<\
The package \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]HSCSolverHomogeneousRadialTeukolsky\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] does not calculate the angular eigenvalue of the \
spin-weighted spheroidal harmonics (SWSH), which must be given as an input. \
For this purpose, we loaded the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]SpinWeightedSpheroidalHarmonics\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
 package of the Black Hole Perturbation Toolkit \
(https://bhptoolkit.org/SpinWeightedSpheroidalHarmonics/)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986197013745318*^9, 
  3.9861972192740517`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0ec45b57-ffa5-4b11-ad83-\
ca3a16885972"],

